      "content": "but it is reality tho. you cant just \"reach out\" to people who have already decided you dont matter. the bridge is burnt. there's no \"path forward\" when there's no one waiting for you at the end of it. it feels like the world just closed its doors and left me outside. like, why even keep pretending?",
